    "summary_insights": [
      "Net assets experienced a significant erosion of 57.8%, falling from £859,340 to £362,845, primarily due to a substantial reduction in retained earnings.",
      "Liquidity remains at a healthy level with a current ratio of 2.02, although this has tightened considerably from the exceptionally high 4.63 seen in 2023.",
      "The cash position decreased by 30.3% (£157,333), while trade debtors also fell by 29.5%, indicating a contraction in trading activity or faster collection.",
      "Tangible fixed assets reduced by 55.6%, largely driven by a significant drop in the net book value of plant and machinery and motor vehicles.",
      "The company has successfully deleveraged its balance sheet, eliminating all bank loans and hire purchase obligations by March 2024.",
      "A notable red flag is the sharp increase in accruals and deferred income, which rose from £3,410 to £118,093, impacting the current liability profile.",
      "Intercompany receivables (amounts owed by group undertakings) fell sharply from £79,136 to just £6,487, suggesting a repatriation of funds or settlement of group balances."
